  "worked_solution": "We calculate the derivative using the product rule, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-2{x}^{4}cot\u2061x) \\\\  & =(-8{x}^{3})(cot\u2061x)+(-2{x}^{4})(-{csc}^{2}\u2061x) \\\\  & =-8{x}^{3}cot\u2061x+2{x}^{4}{csc}^{2}\u2061x\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
